 "remarks": "Fully renovated, innovative living spacious 2 bedroom. Best unit in the building! Brand new kitchen with island for counter seating and brand new bathroom, flex space for living/dining room. Hardwood floors throughout. This amazing building offers a Zen common area equipped with wet bar and microwave for an extra living room feel on 2nd floor, and a large conference room on main floor available to be reserved for outside of office meetings with business hub room. Art House building boasts artistic vibes and a cozy ambiance, perfect place to come home to and relax. Rent includes all utilities and parking, as well as building wifi and laundry! Tenant only needs to get personal wifi if desired.",
